= Frame-free methods: JVM-specific %_ discard + calling-convention docs
A method's implicit %_ is discarded on the JVM when nothing reads it, so the callee can run
frame-free; the calling-convention document and the CcBench harness under docs/bench/callconv;
dispatch-cost profiling recorded, with the liveInvocations over-count fix.
- 704aebd3d7 Frame-free methods: JVM-specific %_ discard + calling-convention docs
- d525048ce4 docs: dispatch-cost profiling + the liveInvocations over-count fix

# NET-ZERO knob: the A/B knob introduced with the lowering and dropped two
# commits later vanish together.
# moved: 04b1309986 pulled earlier past 6f3c25ebfd (AGENTS.md, the calling-convention
# and migration docs); it touches RakOps.kt and docs/jvm-newdisp-port.md only.
= jesp: definite-return-type checks lowered in p6typecheckrv
For a non-generic definite return type the per-signature check cache precomputes the base type
and the wanted concreteness, so p6typecheckrv tests istype(base) plus isconcrete instead of
running the accepts_type cascade on every return; the mismatch/unbox fallback is untouched.
The lowering is unconditional.
- 600e0d4902 jesp: lower definite-return-type checks in p6typecheckrv (kill accepts_type)
- 04b1309986 Drop JESP_RVGUARD_OFF

