= Docs: the nested nqp/ tree named everywhere; frame-free CORE.c stays off
AGENTS.md and the migration and calling-convention docs name the nested nqp/ working tree
wherever it is meant (nqp/ paths, gradle from the root, hashes labeled by tree). A frame-free
CORE.c breaks the CORE.d compile, so the frame-free knob stays off.
