= docs: strict-refusal campaign handoff, Rakudo side; the plan's position
The campaign's handoff document: the facts not to relearn; the nqp bootstrap strict-green and
the runtime regressions of the first strict-green build (a coercing op goes through
encode_child, frame-free blocks vs frame-reading ops, the repeat pre-run); untyped if/ternary
typing; the hllize frame-language bug; CORE.c timings; the Rakudo-side census (10 op refusals,
CORE.c 0), custom_args on the engine, the parse regression accepted; and the Truffle-only
plan's position as of 2026-09-09 with the sidecar placed and the pivot to items 5-6.
